IMG_20230709_154539-16x12.jpg 16w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" data-id=\"9568\"  src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/09\/Copy-of-image99-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9568\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/09\/Copy-of-image99-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/09\/Copy-of-image99-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/09\/Copy-of-image99-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/09\/Copy-of-image99-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/09\/Copy-of-image99-16x12.jpg 16w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/09\/Copy-of-image99.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">More about the <\/a><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">S<\/a><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">T<\/a><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">E<\/a><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">M<\/a><a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" data-type=\"URL\" data-id=\"https:\/\/www.stembees.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">B<\/a><a rel=\"noreferrer noope